Programming Academy bundles wasm-clang-runtime v0.1.0:
https://github.com/cppstudio-io/wasm-clang-runtime/tree/v0.1.0
Clang, LLD and the sysroot are the v0.1.0 release assets, gzip-compressed
for serving as static files. The memfs binary was built from the tag's
src/memfs/memfs.c and stb_sprintf.h with the flags from its build.sh,
using the bundled Clang 22, LLD 22 and WASI sysroot.
Programming Academy modified shared.js to skip size lookup for directories.
The bundled sysroot replaces the teaching iostream stub with libc++'s
original iostream header from llvmorg-22.1.8 (see LICENSE.llvm).
